{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《玫瑰戰爭》第7集劇情大暴走，姚子羚捲入小三疑雲後於深夜慘遭兩名黑衣男伏擊受傷送院。楊茜堯在病榻前強勢介入並承 …</p><p></p>\n<p>《玫瑰戰爭》第7集劇情大暴走，姚子羚捲入小三疑雲後於深夜慘遭兩名黑衣男伏擊受傷送院。楊茜堯在病榻前強勢介入並承諾代為出手對付幕後黑手，同時更著手推動揭露亡故往事專題。這場血腥襲擊背後牽扯出天誠娛樂內部更加錯綜複雜權力暗戰。</p>\n<h2>姚子羚深夜遇襲衣衫不整</h2>\n<p>林夏薇飾演黎綺雲得知鳳儀過往故意隱瞞爆料，直指鳳儀多年來留在身邊是一直「想上位、想取代我」，令兩人深藏已久猜忌徹底浮出水面。鳳儀其後於夜裡街頭突遭兩名戴口罩黑衣男左右夾擊，她被逼至牆角無法掙脫，混亂間額頭受創流下鮮血。畫面可見鳳儀披頭散髮且神情驚恐張嘴叫喊，隨後更因傷勢嚴重被送往醫院留醫，臉頰明顯留有瘀傷及手腕纏滿繃帶。</p>\n<h2>楊茜堯病房霸氣護航 為姚子羚反擊埋伏線</h2>\n<p>鳳儀遇襲後躺在病床上，額頭貼着紗布，臉上瘀傷仍清晰可見。夏無雙（楊茜堯飾）親自到醫院探望，坐在床邊向她承諾：「我幫你去對付你唔敢得罪嘅人。」一句說話盡顯強硬態度，亦令人關注鳳儀究竟忌憚誰。無雙此時出手相助，會否令鳳儀願意吐露更多內情，成為反擊的關鍵，為後續劇情留下懸念。</p>\n<h2>姚子羚遇襲疑團未解 幕後主腦身分引揣測</h2>\n<p>第7集預告曝光後迅速引發廣泛迴響，不少觀眾將焦點放在襲擊事件幕後主腦身份上。大批網民紛紛在討論區留言推測劇情走向，有人直指「林夏薇個角色嫌疑最大」，亦有觀眾被楊茜堯強大氣場震撼，大讚「楊茜堯演技一流」及「期待真相大白嗰刻」。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179483364705398176_18704918106afafcef9bee0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--plyr-43’03”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179483364705398176_18704918106afafcef9bee0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179483364792650466_10948513126afafcf059cb4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--plyr-43’07”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179483364792650466_10948513126afafcf059cb4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179483364921715844_7975425766afafcf19ecb5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--plyr-43’08” (2).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179483364921715844_7975425766afafcf19ecb5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179483365024584816_6048483646afafcf2a29d0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--plyr-43’07” (1).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179483365024584816_6048483646afafcf2a29d0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179483365124957532_9656147846afafcf3a097b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"‘.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179483365124957532_9656147846afafcf3a097b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179483365185641655_3726245296afafcf432f6c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--plyr-43’17” (1).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179483365185641655_3726245296afafcf432f6c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179483365246829669_955829176afafcf4ef31f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--plyr-43’17”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179483365246829669_955829176afafcf4ef31f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179483365325345089_19192804206afafcf5a964a.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"b201f4ba-b537-41de-92ce-050fbf400cb8.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179483365325345089_19192804206afafcf5a964a.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a7%9a%e5%ad%90%e7%be%9a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">姚子羚</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%a5%8a%e8%8c%9c%e5%a0%af/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">楊茜堯</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%8e%ab%e7%91%b0%e6%88%b0%e7%88%ad/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">玫瑰戰爭</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3544188\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 16 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T15:39:53.056498+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1032,"images":8,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T13:30:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T15:33:23.018112+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T15:33:23.018112+00:00","content_hash":"131b8f27bd0fd41c1d9aa71333aa54f666dd5aac8470bfe5f43a767583d05121","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}